<title>BRAZIL: Pao de Acucar H1 net rises vs yr ago.</title>
<headline>Pao de Acucar H1 net rises vs yr ago.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian supermarket chain Pao de Acucar,  known formally as Cia Brasileira de Distribuicao, released the following  first-half financial results.</p>
<p>		 H1 1997		  H1 1996</p>
<p> Net		 62.47 million	  49.3 million</p>
<p> Shr Net	  0.00080		  0.00071</p>
<p> Receipts	 1.486 billion	  1.357 billion</p>
<p> Gross Profit   394.5 million	  334.8 million</p>
<p> Oper Net	 65.6 million	   49.9 million</p>
<p>Note: Figures, which were released to the Sao Paulo Stock Exchange,  are in Brazilian reais and not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
